% 🕹️ Binds the `sci-tonnetz` keys onto the lattice extent and spacing, the highlighted pitch classes and the guitar grid with its fingering.
\keys_define:nn { semio / viz / family / sci-tonnetz }
  {
    mode      .tl_set:N    = \l_semio_viz_sig_mode_tl ,
